      helpHTML('ov-rp', 'Remote Play',
        'Any controller or mouse and keyboard you plug into the adapter drives your PS5 '+
        'over the network, signed in as the account named above. No cable to the console '+
        'and no licensed pad needed — but Remote Play adds its own delay.');
