      h += note('Goes out through the <b>wired PS5 adapter</b> — nothing streams, so there is '+
                'no PlayStation account here.')+
        helpHTML('ov-pico', 'P5General, the wired PS5 adapter',
          'The board feeds the RP2040, which plugs into the PS5 with the Besavior P5General as '+
          'the donor that answers the console’s authentication. Wired, the lowest delay of '+
          'the PlayStation paths, and proven on a PS5 on 2026-09-08. Step <b>Console Connection</b> '+
